OL,3,GNEWSAFire 'severely damaged' Bermondsey
OL,4,Awaste centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire involving 50 tonnes of household
OL,7,Fwaste has "severely damaged" a
OL,8,Frecycling facility in south-east
OL,9,FLondon.
OL,11,FFifteen fire engines were called to
OL,12,FLandmann Way in Bermondsey shortly
OL,13,Fbefore 20:00 BST on Monday.
OL,15,FLondon Fire Brigade (LFB) said the fire
OL,16,Fwas brought under control just after
OL,17,F02:00 on Wednesday, with crews
OL,18,Fremaining on scene to extinguish
OL,19,Fpockets of fire.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
